<http://www.w3.org/ns/sosa/ObservingProcedure> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#example> "[ISO 19156:2023] An instance of Procedure is a description of the process used by an observer. This could be a chemical analysis method, a protocol for measuring an object, or even a checklist used by a human observer during a biodiversity campaign. Procedure could further describe the algorithms behind simulators or models used to generate a result from other inputs."@en .
